{"id":8389157,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/1547","number":1547,"state":"merged","title":"【im2col】修改gather全载模版入口条件，按实际HW大小计算输入输出比率","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/1547","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/1547/issues","body":"## 描述\n解决im2col算子精度问题：当输入输出比值较大（输出远大于输入），gather模版通过输出索引反推输入索引时，算出的输入索引大于数据类型上限，索引溢出导致位置计算错误，临界值为输入/输入>=512。而代码中的比值判断是经过32B对齐后的，存在的问题场景：对齐前输入/输入>=512，对齐后输入/输入<128，仍然走全载模版，出现上述错误\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/904\n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [x] 其他，请描述：\n修改了 NCHWTryFullLoad 函数中的核心判断逻辑，将用于计算输入输出比例的 ratio 从基于对齐后内存大小的 (inHWNeedSize) / outHWNeedSize，更正为基于原始数据元素数量的 (inputHW) / outputHW。\n","assignees_number":9,"assignees":[{"id":"6822d21660184036954b1468","login":"wangrui_","name":"RuiWang_","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangrui_","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","login":"zhangyuxiang0119","name":"张喻翔","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/ef/1470773a2803ce17fd42f4bc8760feb28790f49717caa969d7dac783ff8fecf6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng","assignee":t